WEBVTT

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:15.992
We should go there!

00:00:16.035 --> 00:00:19.125
No. No one
is going anywhere.

00:00:19.648 --> 00:00:20.649
[SNIFFING]

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:24.087
What else did that boy say?

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.741
[BIRD CAWING]

00:00:25.784 --> 00:00:26.785
[ALL GASP]

00:00:33.662 --> 00:00:34.793
[GROWLS]

00:00:37.883 --> 00:00:38.884
Ah!

00:00:41.321 --> 00:00:42.453
[GRUNTS]

00:00:48.894 --> 00:00:49.895
Grug?

00:00:50.635 --> 00:00:52.202
Just go! Just go!

00:00:52.245 --> 00:00:53.290
Go!

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:54.508
[ALL SCREAMING]

00:01:04.257 --> 00:01:05.519
[ALL GROANING]

00:01:07.521 --> 00:01:08.522
Ow!

00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:10.133
[EXHALES]

00:01:10.176 --> 00:01:11.351
[GRUNTS]
[GIGGLES]

00:01:12.657 --> 00:01:16.748
One, two, three,
four, five--

00:01:18.837 --> 00:01:20.099
[GASPS]Oh!

00:01:20.143 --> 00:01:21.448
Six. [SIGHS]

00:01:22.275 --> 00:01:24.321
[GROANS]
Where are we?

00:01:24.364 --> 00:01:26.671
I don't know.
I'm not sure.

00:01:26.715 --> 00:01:28.586
Down.

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:30.980
In a lower place.

00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:34.331
But one thing is for sure,
we can't go back
the way we came.

00:01:35.724 --> 00:01:37.987
[GROWLS]
Sandy? What is it?

00:01:39.553 --> 00:01:41.773
No, no, no.
Wait. Come back, Sandy!

00:01:42.339 --> 00:01:43.383
[TRUMPETS]

00:01:43.427 --> 00:01:44.471
Ah!

00:01:44.515 --> 00:01:45.516
Ugh!

00:01:46.038 --> 00:01:47.126
[TRUMPETING]

00:01:48.824 --> 00:01:51.130
We can't be out in
the open like this.

00:01:51.174 --> 00:01:52.610
[ALL TRUMPETING]

00:01:53.524 --> 00:01:55.395
We need a cave.

00:01:55.439 --> 00:01:58.224
Now, step where I step.

00:01:58.877 --> 00:02:00.705
Okay. Stay quiet.

00:02:00.749 --> 00:02:03.186
Hopefully, nothing big
knows we're here yet.

00:02:13.022 --> 00:02:14.110
GRUG: Wait.

00:02:15.415 --> 00:02:16.721
Okay.

00:02:16.765 --> 00:02:17.853
Wait.

00:02:18.592 --> 00:02:20.072
Okay.

00:02:20.116 --> 00:02:21.291
Wait!

00:02:21.334 --> 00:02:22.901
ALL: Whoa!

00:02:26.209 --> 00:02:27.210
Wait.

00:02:30.126 --> 00:02:31.431
Okay.

00:02:31.475 --> 00:02:32.737
Wait.

00:02:32.781 --> 00:02:34.086
[SQUAWKING]

00:02:36.785 --> 00:02:37.742
GRUG: Wait.

00:02:47.926 --> 00:02:49.406
THUNK: Um, so, Dad...

00:02:49.449 --> 00:02:53.018
just to be clear,
are we looking for
the exact same cave?

00:02:53.062 --> 00:02:55.629
If it was me--
I'm just throwing
this out there...

00:02:55.673 --> 00:02:58.110
if it was me
choosing the cave...

00:02:58.154 --> 00:02:59.155
[ALL CHITTERING]

00:03:00.809 --> 00:03:03.420
I would go with
a smaller cave.

00:03:03.812 --> 00:03:04.900
[GASPS]

00:03:04.943 --> 00:03:05.944
Wait.

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:08.077
[ALL CHITTERING]

00:03:09.818 --> 00:03:11.080
Dad?

00:03:11.123 --> 00:03:12.821
I'll take care of this.

00:03:12.864 --> 00:03:14.083
[YELLING]

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.305
Uh...

00:03:19.349 --> 00:03:20.350
Hmm.

00:03:22.613 --> 00:03:24.615
All right, Dad, get them!
Go get them!

00:03:24.658 --> 00:03:26.095
Now you got
them right--

00:03:26.138 --> 00:03:27.400
Man, they're really--

00:03:27.444 --> 00:03:28.750
[CHUCKLES]
I'm loving this.

00:03:29.707 --> 00:03:30.795
THUNK:
Dad, I got it.

00:03:30.839 --> 00:03:32.449
Just stop running
into their fists.

00:03:33.972 --> 00:03:36.627
Grug, when you're done,
we should get going.

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:37.671
Whoa!

00:03:40.457 --> 00:03:41.893
[LAUGHS]

00:03:41.937 --> 00:03:44.853
That's right.
You can't get past this!

00:03:45.375 --> 00:03:46.593
[GROWLING]

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:49.945
[ALL GASP]

00:03:58.692 --> 00:03:59.693
[GRUNTS]

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.308
[ROARS]

00:04:05.351 --> 00:04:07.397
Climb! Climb! Climb!

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:09.529
[ALL SCREAMING]

00:04:11.749 --> 00:04:13.098
THUNK: Whoa!

00:04:14.752 --> 00:04:15.927
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:04:15.971 --> 00:04:17.102
Cave!

00:04:17.146 --> 00:04:18.669
Go! Go!

00:04:18.712 --> 00:04:21.063
Come on!
Hurry up. Let's go.

00:04:23.369 --> 00:04:26.372
THUNK: Look! This cave
has a tongue. Awesome!

00:04:27.286 --> 00:04:28.548
[BUBBLING]

00:04:31.203 --> 00:04:32.509
[ALL SCREAMING]

00:04:36.382 --> 00:04:37.514
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:04:39.908 --> 00:04:41.387
Ew! Ew!

00:04:41.431 --> 00:04:42.693
[HEAVY FOOTSTEPS RETREATING]

00:04:42.736 --> 00:04:44.347
Okay.

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:48.655
That's one, two,
three, four, five, six.

00:04:48.699 --> 00:04:50.527
And seven...

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:54.183
if we're counting
Chunky the Death Cat.

00:04:54.226 --> 00:04:55.401
[GROWLING]

00:04:55.445 --> 00:04:56.881
[ALL GASP]

00:05:00.798 --> 00:05:01.886
[WHIMPERS]

00:05:03.192 --> 00:05:04.323
THUNK: Ha!

00:05:04.367 --> 00:05:06.412
It's scared of the dark.
[LAUGHS]

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:10.025
Wait, we're scared
of the dark.

00:05:20.078 --> 00:05:21.166
[CHIRPS]

00:05:23.255 --> 00:05:24.604
[BIRDS CHIRPING]

00:05:30.784 --> 00:05:31.960
[ALL GASPING]

00:05:43.841 --> 00:05:45.103
[ALL SCREAM]

00:05:46.975 --> 00:05:48.280
[GASPS]
Kill circle!

00:05:58.116 --> 00:05:59.117
Eep!

00:06:00.466 --> 00:06:01.946
[GRUNTS]

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:02.947
[PLAYS LOW NOTE]

00:06:06.342 --> 00:06:07.343
[GASPS]

00:06:19.181 --> 00:06:20.269
[CONTINUES PLAYING LOW NOTE]

00:06:20.312 --> 00:06:21.313
Eep!

00:06:24.577 --> 00:06:25.578
[GRUNTS]

00:06:28.146 --> 00:06:29.147
[BLOWING]

